  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Add lamb chops and sear on all sides until golden brown, about 4 minutes per side.",
    "Remove lamb from pot and set aside.",
    "Sauté onions, ginger, and garlic until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add carrots and parsnips to the pot with some of their cooking liquid.",
    "Return seared lamb to the pot along with sweet paprika, smoked paprika, brown sugar, salt, thyme, and pomegranate molasses.",
    "Simmer gently for about 15 minutes, adding more water if needed to keep ingredients submerged.",
    "Serve hot as a main course or side dish."
